# EVRP instance: sample
# Small handcrafted instance for smoke-testing the solver.
#
# 5 customers, 2 charging stations, 3 vehicles.
# Depot at origin; nodes scattered on a 60x60 grid.
n_customers 5
n_stations  2
n_vehicles  3
max_load    100
battery_capacity 60
consumption_rate 1
0 depot              0   0
1 customer          10  20  20
2 customer          30  10  30
3 customer          20  40  15
4 customer          50  30  25
5 customer          40  50  10
6 charging_station  15  35
7 charging_station  45  15
